Testing switch-case (dooro/xaalad) statements:
\n1. Simple switch with integer:
  number = 2
  Laba (Two)
\n2. Switch with strings:
  language = Somali
  Salaan, Adduunka!
\n3. Switch with expressions:
  x = 10, y = 20
  x + y equals 30
\n4. Switch with decimal values:
  decimal = 1.5
  decimal equals 1.5
\n5. Nested switch statements:
  outer = 1, inner = 2
  Outer case is 1
  Inner case is 2
\n6. Switch with function result:
  option = B
  Option B selected
\n7. Switch with boolean value:
  is_active = run
  The system is active
\nSwitch-case tests completed!
